			],
			"color":"#233",
			"widgets_values":[
				"Based strictly on the visual style of the bride in the [Character Reference Image 1] (wavy brown hair, white off-the-shoulder ruffled gown, blue crystal necklace) and the soldier in [Character Reference Image 2] (black tactical armor, grey combat helmet), generate a cinematic, high-octane 15-second video following the [Storyboard Reference Image] sequence. \n\nThe video opens with a high-speed tracking shot of the bride sprinting through a war-torn sunset ruin (panels 1-3), her white dress contrasting with the blood-red sky as she gasps: “我一定要找到他！” The camera cuts sharply to a dusty trench where she slides down to find the soldier (panels 4-6); she thrusts a strategic map into his hands, shouting: “这是最后的坐标，任务还没结束！” In a brief, intimate moment (panels 7-9), the soldier’s dirty hands pin a bronze star badge onto her ruffled bodice, whispering: “等我回来。” Suddenly, the rhythm accelerates into a series of violent, slow-motion explosions (panels 10-12); the soldier throws his body over her as debris rains down. They scramble up from the dirt (panels 13-15), the bride’s face now smeared with soot as she helps him recalibrate his headset. The camera transitions into a wide, shaky-cam shot of them advancing through heavy gunfire and thick smoke alongside other troops (panels 16-21), the soldier firing his rifle while the bride stays low by his side. The final sequence (panels 22-25) slows down as the smoke clears; they stand amidst the smoldering battlefield, looking into each other’s eyes with a mixture of exhaustion and triumph, as he says: “走吧，我们回家。” The lighting shifts from harsh orange fire to a soft, hazy glow. The entire 15-second film is characterized by rapid cuts, intense motion blur, and seamless transitions between the storyboard beats. The final output must be a clean video feed with NO on-screen text, subtitles, captions, or watermarks generated by the model."
			],
